        {
          "body": "[P1] Preserve the selector measurements collected above\n\nThis merge adds selector observations, but the following assignments reset `selector_elapsed_ms`, `selector_usage`, `selector_concurrency`, and `selector_retries` to `None` before producing the report. Even when the terminal/result/archive chain verifies successfully, the resource gate therefore sees these required measurements as unknown and cannot evaluate the selector resource limits. Keep the values derived from `selector`, while leaving only the genuinely unmeasured stage-wide duration unknown.",
